  "story": {
    "title": "Picture Conversations-Describing words",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "I am Devi. I like to wear yellow dress. Which colour dress do you like to wear?",
      "Mmm.Laddoos! I love to eat these sweet laddoos. Do you know any other sweet like laddoo?",
      "I write with my pencil. I have two pencils in my box. How many pencils do you have in your box?",
      "Devi was a happy girl. Her grandmother told her stories everyday. She felt happy listening to the stories. Can you tell me something that made you happy?",
      "I am a short boy. I cannot reach the cap kept on top shelf. Are you short or are you tall? Is there anyone who is taller than you?"
    ],
    "sentences": [
